sed": {"depth_limit": 0, "concurrency_limit": 0, "budget": 0}, "by_type": {"implementer": 1}}, "safety_stops": 0, "is_error": false, "num_turns": 2, "subtype": "success", "api_error_status": null, "result": "Overrides passed with `-x` or `TOX_OVERRIDE` now go through the loader's substitution pass, so `{posargs}`, `{env:VAR}` and `{env_name}` resolve instead of arriving as literal text.\n\n`.venv/bin/python -m pytest -q tests/config/loader/test_loader.py` gives 33 passed, and I reran it myself after the implementer finished. I read the full diff and it matches the spec.\n\nThe implementer also ran the rest of `tests/config`, which gave 6663 passed and 2 skipped. It had to leave out `tests/config/cli/test_argcomplete.py`, which fails at collection because `argcomplete` isn't installed in `.venv`.\n\nI didn't build the docs.\n\n- **Loader code:** `Loader.load` substitutes each override value before converting it, except for `set_env` and loads with no `conf`. `Loader.substitute` is new, with the ini and TOML loaders each supplying their own version.\n- **Docs:** I added `docs/changelog/4047.bugfix.rst` and a \"Substitutions inside an override\" section in `docs/reference/config.rst`.", "ttft_ms": 2132, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 6951, "uuid": "91ab21a8-2c6c-40cb-856f-19c115319ebc", "ttft_stream_ms": 1582, "time_to_request_ms": 16, "first_content_frame_ms": 1582, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 1}
